# Sidecar / Init Container Demo

This folder demonstrates a pod pattern that includes an init container before the main application container starts.

## What it does

The pod has:

- a main container running an application
- an init container that waits or prepares the environment before startup

This is useful for startup ordering, dependency checks, or pre-run setup tasks.

## Example purpose

- delay container startup until setup is complete
- run a setup routine before the real app starts
- simulate initialization behavior in a small Kubernetes example
